  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/4dca46f39a84a1663618a430e087d88ac10e3c3e2017cdea8d45b1b476b9b3e9.png] \n\nGiven equation: 14 - 15 ÷ 2 + 56 × 14 = ? \n\nIf ‘+' and ‘-’ and ‘×' and '÷' are interchanged then we get:\n\n⇒ 14 + 15 × 2 - **__56 __****__÷__****__ 14__** = ? \n\n⇒ 14 + **__15 × 2__ **- 4 = ?\n\n⇒ __**14 + **____**30__** - 4 = ?\n\n⇒ **__44__**__** - 4**__ = ? = **40**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"40\".**",
